      "name": "write_review",
      "args": {
        "content": "{\n  \"module\": \"multi-page-support\",\n  \"verdict\": \"needs_changes\",\n  \"tool_calls\": 74,\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"blocker\",\n      \"file\": \"packages/excalidraw/tests/pages.test.tsx\",\n      \"line\": 342,\n      \"issue\": \"Three defects cause typecheck and test failures in pages.test.tsx: (1) line 342 calls h.store.scheduleCapture(CaptureUpdateAction.IMMEDIATELY) with 1 argument, but Store.scheduleCapture() takes 0 arguments (TS2554); (2) in AC-6 (line 454), exportScene({ type: 'png', config: { embedScene: true } }) calls HTMLCanvasElement.prototype.toBlob which in JSDOM produces an empty non-PNG blob that fails PNG chunk decoding and times out after 5000ms; (3) in AC-7 (line 516), container.querySelector('.search-menu input') returns null because SearchMenu renders its input under `.${CLASSES.SEARCH_MENU_INPUT_WRAPPER} input` (and ListItem calls HTMLElement.prototype.scrollIntoView which is undefined in JSDOM unless mocked).\",\n      \"fix\": \"Call h.store.scheduleCapture() with 0 arguments at line 342; in AC-6, spy on HTMLCanvasElement.prototype.toBlob to pass a valid PNG fixture blob (`const basePng = await API.loadFile('./fixtures/smiley.png')`) before calling exportScene({ type: 'png', ... }) and restore the spy afterward; in AC-7, mock `window.HTMLElement.prototype.scrollIntoView = vi.fn()` and query `.${CLASSES.SEARCH_MENU_INPUT_WRAPPER} input` (importing CLASSES from @excalidraw/common).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"severity\": \"major\",\n      \"file\": \"packages/excalidraw/scene/export.ts\",\n      \"line\": 1342,\n      \"issue\": \"In exportToBlob, the async callback passed to canvas.toBlob awaits encodePngMetadata without a try/catch block, so any error thrown during PNG metadata encoding results in an unhandled promise rejection and leaves the exportToBlob Promise unsettled forever.\",\n      \"fix\": \"Wrap the PNG embedScene block and resolve(blob) inside canvas.toBlob's async callback in a try { ... } catch (error) { reject(error); } block so errors properly reject the r"
      },
      "canonical_path": null,
      "args_clipped": true
    }
  ],
  "text": "Review written to `.sdlc/runs/20261106-152445-feature-new-pages/review.json` (`verdict: \"needs_changes\"`).\n\n### Findings\n1. **Blocker \u2014 `packages/excalidraw/tests/pages.test.tsx:342`**:\n   - Line 342 calls `h.store.scheduleCapture(CaptureUpdateAction.IMMEDIATELY)`, causing `TS2554` because `Store.scheduleCapture()` takes 0 arguments.\n   - Line 454 (AC-6) calls `exportScene({ type: \"png\", config: { embedScene: true } })`, which uses JSDOM's mock `canvas.toBlob` (producing an empty non-PNG blob that fails PNG chunk decoding and hangs for 5000ms); spy on `HTMLCanvasElement.prototype.toBlob` with `./fixtures/smiley.png`.\n   - Line 516 (AC-7) queries `.search-menu input` (which does not exist; `SearchMenu` uses `.${CLASSES.SEARCH_MENU_INPUT_WRAPPER} input`) and needs `window.HTMLElement.prototype.scrollIntoView = vi.fn()` for JSDOM.\n2. **Major \u2014 `packages/excalidraw/scene/export.ts:1342`**:\n   - `exportToBlob` awaits `encodePngMetadata` inside `canvas.toBlob`'s `async` callback without `try / catch`, leaving the outer `Promise` unsettled if `encodePngMetadata` throws.\n3. **Minor \u2014 `packages/excalidraw/data/blob.ts:168`**:\n   - `loadSceneOrLibraryFromBlob` spreads `getScrollToContentState` even when `data.appState.pages` is non-empty; guard with `!Array.isArray(data.appState?.pages) || data.appState.pages.length === 0` per U15 Rule 1.\n4. **Minor \u2014 `packages/element/src/arrows/helpers.ts:11`, `packages/excalidraw/components/App.selectionTool.ts:93`, `packages/excalidraw/components/App.wrap.ts:91`, `packages/excalidraw/components/ConvertElementTypePopup.tsx:848`**:\n   - Unplanned `App` / `AppClassProperties` parameter type changes from an earlier debug round are no longer needed and should be reverted to `HEAD`.\n\n### Passing Checks\n- **Gate 0 & Snapshots**: Fixed `DEFAULT_PAGE_ID = \"page-default\"` / `DEFAULT_PAGE_NAME = \"Page 1\"` with zero new random draws; snapshot updates only add `activePageId` and `pages`.\n- **Scene, Store, History & Collab**: Multi-page element isolation, tombstone page deletion, per-element-page undo filing, and Firebase/WebSocket page list persistence (including `loadFromFirebase` and `saveCollabRoomToFirebase` page attachment) match `change_plan.md`.",
